"shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"zRWtPxp8lHfcGtIl15_iXA","review_id":"0-zIfAEC7o4DnAH0yVppuA","date":"2019-01-06T00:10:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9611591696739197,"text_excerpt":"Who doesn't love poke? My second time visiting this location and everything was perfect. I usually get the veggie bowl with tofu and ALL of the toppings. It taste like a deconstructed sushi roll...yum. The set up is pretty cool. You can choose from signature bowls or build your own. It also comes in two sizes, regular and large. The regular is plenty, trust me and I can eat. This is a great choice for a quick lunch or light dinner. However, when I say light, don't think that means you will not be overly stuffed. Another plus for Poke Loa is that they serve mix drinks and beer. Happy hour specials are available through the weekend. Fresh, tasty and filling bowls. You will not be disappoint..."},{"business_id":"zRWtPxp8lHfcGtIl15_iXA","review_id":"oHCEJ7PXQVVozoyqbN_J2A","date":"2018-04-06T18:28:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9515359997749329,"text_excerpt":"I think Poke Loa is a great addition to the CBD! It's right across from the CBD Rouses and has plenty of seating available. Saw lots of folks who worked at close by businesses stopping in for their lunch break. I went probably at their busiest time of the day and got in and out in less than 10 minutes. They had a ton of employees on the floor so the line moved quickly. Everyone was super friendly and very efficient! The space is super hip looking (do the kids still say hip?) and clean. I've frequented the magazine street location in the past and feel like this location is good food/service consistency wise. A slight difference is this one has a bar with booze and happy hour! #treatyoself ..."},{"business_id":"zRWtPxp8lHfcGtIl15_iXA","review_id":"82X2CPz4AeTuk-UEZmvtew","date":"2019-05-23T23:24:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9404981136322021,"text_excerpt":"I know I may be a little late to the poke bowl game, but this was my first time trying it. It's like a deconstructed sushi roll but in a bowl? You can build your own or choose from their signature ones. A coworker and I arrived at lunch time with a few people ahead of us but the line was moving along pretty quickly. The menu was pretty self explanatory and the workers were pretty helpful as to making recommendations on what to add to my bowl. I ordered a reg bowl that included two scoops of protein. I added half spring mix/brown rice, shrimp, cucumbers, cilantro, ponzu and sesame oil as my dressing. Topped with seaweed & crab salad, wonton chips, orange tobiko, and lemon aioli. I love the..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"zRWtPxp8lHfcGtIl15_iXA","photo_id":"f63mhwXOGnTjfuK3zLQrrQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/f63mhwXOGnTjfuK3zLQrrQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.892816424369812},{"business_id":"zRWtPxp8lHfcGtIl15_iXA","photo_id":"CLAiWG3ggRcMhEe5HoiSUg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CLAiWG3ggRcMhEe5HoiSUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8927373290061951},{"business_id":"zRWtPxp8lHfcGtIl15_iXA","photo_id":"wFVV0255OJmEq8LV9CQm8A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/wFVV0255OJmEq8LV9CQm8A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8854795694351196},{"business_id":"zRWtPxp8lHfcGtIl15_iXA","photo_id":"DogH-U5OrMoQCy4mTVAueQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/DogH-U5OrMoQCy4mTVAueQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8246009349822998}]},"notebook_case":null}
